===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|advertisen}}, from {{der|en|xno|advertir||to inform}}, {{m|xno|avertir}}, {{der|en|frm|advertir}}, {{m|fr|avertir||to warn, give notice to}}, with the French {{m|fr|-iss-}} infix assimilated to {{m|en|-ise}}, {{m|en|-ize}} and probably influenced by the noun {{m|en|advertisement}}. Compare also {{m|en|advert}}.

